#: .\venv\Lib\site-packages\django\views\csrf.py:116
msgid ""
"You are seeing this message because this HTTPS site requires a “Referer "
"header” to be sent by your web browser, but none was sent. This header is "
"required for security reasons, to ensure that your browser is not being "
"hijacked by third parties."
msgstr ""
"أنت are seeing this الرسالة لأن this HTTPS site requires a “Referer header” "
"إلى يكون sent by your web المتصفح, but none was sent. This header is مطلوب "
"عن الأمان reasons, إلى ensure that your المتصفح is غير being hijacked by "
"third parties."

#: .\venv\Lib\site-packages\django\views\csrf.py:122
msgid ""
"If you have configured your browser to disable “Referer” headers, please re-"
"enable them, at least for this site, or for HTTPS connections, or for “same-"
"origin” requests."
msgstr ""
"If you have configured your المتصفح إلى disable “Referer” headers, يرجى re-"
"enable them, at least عن this site, أو عن HTTPS connections, أو عن “same-"
"origin” requests."

#: .\venv\Lib\site-packages\django\views\csrf.py:127
msgid ""
"If you are using the <meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"no-referrer\"> tag or "
"including the “Referrer-Policy: no-referrer” header, please remove them. The "
"CSRF protection requires the “Referer” header to do strict referer checking. "
"If you’re concerned about privacy, use alternatives like <a rel=\"noreferrer"
"\" …> for links to third-party sites."
msgstr ""
"If you are using the <meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"no-referrer\"> الوسم "
"أو including the “Referrer-Policy: no-referrer” header, يرجى remove them. ال "
"CSRF protection requires the “Referer” header إلى do strict referer "
"checking. If you’re concerned about privacy, use alternatives like <a rel="
"\"noreferrer\" …> عن links إلى third-party sites."

#: .\venv\Lib\site-packages\django\views\csrf.py:136
msgid ""
"You are seeing this message because this site requires a CSRF cookie when "
"submitting forms. This cookie is required for security reasons, to ensure "
"that your browser is not being hijacked by third parties."
msgstr ""
"أنت are seeing this الرسالة لأن this site requires a CSRF cookie when "
"submitting forms. This cookie is مطلوب عن الأمان reasons, إلى ensure that "
"your المتصفح is غير being hijacked by third parties."

#: .\venv\Lib\site-packages\django\views\csrf.py:142
